    "physicalNotes": [
      "Seat U1 with pin 1 at F12. Tie both preset and clear pairs to VCC. Ground the unused clock and data inputs.",
      "Leave unused outputs 6, 8, and 9 isolated. Use common-ground 0 V or 5 V data and clock signals.",
      "Apply a rising clock edge after setting D. A 2.2 kΩ resistor limits LED current."
